[I] Core utilities for Python packages

[T] This library provides utilities that implement the interoperability
[T] specifications which have clearly one correct behaviour (eg: PEP 440)
[T] or benefit greatly from having a single shared implementation (eg: PEP
[T] 425). The packaging project includes the following: version handling,
[T] specifiers, markers, requirements, tags, utilities.

[U] https://github.com/pypa/packaging

